    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2800" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰχμά̆λ-ωτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>taken by the spear, captive,
				prisoner</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				223
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				134
			</span></i>; freq. of women, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1440
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				417
			</span></i>:— <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰχμάλωτοι</span>
